/// new table) pair the old table is copied with <c>DataTransfer</c> when it still exists in
/// the database and the new table is empty; BLOB fields, which DataTransfer does not support,
/// are copied afterwards with a RecordRef pass. Values that stored an object id or an enum
/// ordinal from an old object-id range are shifted into the new ranges, and every user that
/// held one of the old permission sets is granted the matching Bifrost one. Execution logs
